{"id":"chokes-names-and-marks","rev":2,"lang":"lt","status":"published","review_flag":null,"disclaimer":null,"title":"Čokų pavadinimai, susiaurinimai ir žymėjimai","summary":"Nuo cilindro iki pilno: tipiniai susiaurinimai milimetrais ir thou, dalys 1/4–1/2–3/4 ir žvaigždutės, naudojamos Sporting™ ir Compak® Sporting. Reikšmės apytikslės ir skiriasi tarp gamintojų.","body":[{"k":"gear-chokes-p3","t":"p","html":"Pavadinimai atkeliavo iš anglų kalbos, nuo atviriausio iki tankiausio: <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/cylinder/\"><span lang=\"en\">cylinder</span> (cilindras)</a>, improved cylinder, light modified, modified, improved modified, full. Europiečiai dažnai juos vadina dalimis: quarter – <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/improved-cylinder/\"><span lang=\"en\">improved cylinder</span> (ketvirtis)</a>, half – <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/modified/\"><span lang=\"en\">modified</span> (pusė, pusčokas)</a>, three-quarter – <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/improved-modified/\"><span lang=\"en\">improved modified</span> (trys ketvirčiai)</a> ir full – <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/full-choke/\"><span lang=\"en\">full choke</span> (pilnas)</a>. Daug itališkų šautuvų <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/choke/\"><span lang=\"en\">choke</span> (čokus)</a> žymi <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/star-marks/\"><span lang=\"en\">star marks</span> (žvaigždutėmis)</a>, ir ten logika atvirkštinė: kuo daugiau žvaigždučių, tuo atviresnis čokas.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null},{"k":"dg-choke-scale","t":"diagram","html":"<figure class=\"dg\" aria-labelledby=\"dg-choke-scale\"><p class=\"dg-h\" id=\"dg-choke-scale\">Čokai nuo atviro iki siauro</p><svg class=\"dg-svg\" viewBox=\"20 20 640 300\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"dg-choke-scale\" focusable=\"false\"><rect class=\"dg-bar0\" x=\"104\" y=\"167\" width=\"52\" height=\"3\" rx=\"3\"/><text class=\"dg-val\" x=\"130\" y=\"162\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0 mm</text><text class=\"dg-nm\" x=\"130\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Cyl</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"middle\">—</text><text class=\"dg-star\" x=\"130\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\">★★★★★</text><rect class=\"dg-bar1\" x=\"196\" y=\"140\" width=\"52\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\"/><text class=\"dg-val\" x=\"222\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"middle\">≈0,25 mm</text><text class=\"dg-nm\" x=\"222\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"middle\">IC</text><text x=\"222\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1/4</text><text class=\"dg-star\" x=\"222\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\">★★★★</text><rect class=\"dg-bar2\" x=\"288\" y=\"125\" width=\"52\" height=\"45\" rx=\"3\"/><text class=\"dg-val\" x=\"314\" y=\"117\" text-anchor=\"middle\">≈0,35–0,4</text><text class=\"dg-nm\" x=\"314\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"middle\">LM</text><text x=\"314\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3/8</text><text class=\"dg-star\" x=\"314\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\">—</text><rect class=\"dg-bar3\" x=\"380\" y=\"110\" width=\"52\" height=\"60\" rx=\"3\"/><text class=\"dg-val\" x=\"406\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\">≈0,5 mm</text><text class=\"dg-nm\" x=\"406\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M</text><text x=\"406\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1/2</text><text class=\"dg-star\" x=\"406\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\">★★★</text><rect class=\"dg-bar4\" x=\"472\" y=\"86\" width=\"52\" height=\"84\" rx=\"3\"/><text class=\"dg-val\" x=\"498\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\">≈0,65–0,75</text><text class=\"dg-nm\" x=\"498\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"middle\">IM</text><text x=\"498\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3/4</text><text class=\"dg-star\" x=\"498\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\">★★</text><rect class=\"dg-bar5\" x=\"564\" y=\"56\" width=\"52\" height=\"114\" rx=\"3\"/><text class=\"dg-val\" x=\"590\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\">≈0,9–1 mm</text><text class=\"dg-nm\" x=\"590\" y=\"200\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Full</text><text x=\"590\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1/1</text><text class=\"dg-star\" x=\"590\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"middle\">★</text>\n<path class=\"dg-base\" d=\"M96 170H594\"/><path class=\"dg-arr\" d=\"M110 296H580\"/><path class=\"dg-arrh\" d=\"M580 289l14 7-14 7z\"/><g class=\"dg-n\"><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"120\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text></g><g class=\"dg-n\"><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"195\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">2</text></g><g class=\"dg-n\"><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"231\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"231\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">3</text></g><g class=\"dg-n\"><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"265\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">4</text></g><g class=\"dg-n\"><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"296\" r=\"14\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"296\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">5</text></g></svg><ol class=\"dg-leg\"><li><b aria-hidden=\"true\">1</b>Susiaurinimas milimetrais (apytiksliai)</li><li><b aria-hidden=\"true\">2</b>Angliškas pavadinimas</li><li><b aria-hidden=\"true\">3</b>Trupmena, kaip sakoma Europoje</li><li><b aria-hidden=\"true\">4</b>Italų gamintojų žvaigždučių žymėjimas: daugiau žvaigždučių – atviresnis čokas</li><li><b aria-hidden=\"true\">5</b>Nuo atviro iki siauro</li></ol><figcaption>Įprasti susiaurinimai 12 kalibrui; tikros vertės priklauso nuo gamintojo ir vamzdžio. LM šiame žymėjime žvaigždučių neturi.</figcaption></figure>","disc":null,"rule_ref":null},{"k":"chokes-names-and-marks-p1","t":"p","html":"Žemiau – tipiniai <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/constriction/\"><span lang=\"en\">constriction</span> (susiaurinimai)</a> 12 kalibrui. Vienas thou – tai tūkstantoji colio dalis, apie 0,025 mm. Tikros reikšmės priklauso nuo gamintojo ir net nuo konkretaus vamzdžio kanalo.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null},{"k":"chokes-names-and-marks-p2","t":"steps","html":["Cylinder (cilindras): be susiaurinimo, 0 mm.","1/8: labai nedidelis susiaurinimas, apie 0,1–0,15 mm (4–6 thou), tarp cylinder ir improved cylinder; gamintojai jį vadina įvairiai.","Improved cylinder (IC): apie 0,25 mm (apie 10 thou), Europoje – 1/4, „ketvirtis“.","Light modified (LM): apie 0,35–0,4 mm (apie 15 thou), kartais žymimas 3/8.","Modified (M): apie 0,5 mm (apie 20 thou), 1/2, „pusčokas“.","Improved modified (IM): apie 0,65–0,75 mm (25–30 thou), 3/4.","Full: apie 0,9–1 mm (35–40 thou), 1/1 arba tiesiog Full. Yra ir tankesnių čokų (extra full), bet stendiniam šaudymui jų reikia retai."],"disc":null,"rule_ref":null},{"k":"chokes-names-and-marks-p5","t":"p","html":"Dalys parankios pokalbiui, bet tai nėra tikslūs milimetrai: vieno gamintojo 1/2 gali truputį skirtis nuo kito gamintojo 1/2.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null},{"k":"chokes-names-and-marks-p6","t":"p","html":"Itališki gamintojai, pavyzdžiui, Beretta, naudoja žvaigždutes: penkios – cylinder, keturios – improved cylinder (1/4), trys – modified (1/2), dvi – improved modified (3/4), viena – full. Kiti gamintojai vamzdelio kraštą pažymi įrantomis, naudoja spalvotas juosteles arba užrašo pavadinimą (IC, M, LM).","disc":null,"rule_ref":null},{"k":"chokes-names-and-marks-p7","t":"tip","html":"Patikimiausia – perskaityti žymėjimą ant paties čoko arba šautuvo instrukcijoje. Jei abejojate, <a class=\"term\" href=\"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/gunsmith/\"><span lang=\"en\">gunsmith</span> (ginklininkas)</a> per minutę išmatuos susiaurinimą specialiu kalibru.","disc":null,"rule_ref":null}],"notes":[],"phrases":[],"key_points":[{"k":"chokes-names-and-marks-kp1","html":"Cylinder 0 · 1/8 ~0,1–0,15 mm · IC ~0,25 mm (1/4) · LM ~0,35–0,4 mm","checklist":false},{"k":"chokes-names-and-marks-kp2","html":"M ~0,5 mm (1/2) · IM ~0,65–0,75 mm (3/4) · Full ~0,9–1 mm (1/1)","checklist":false},{"k":"gear-chokes-kp3","html":"Dalys: ketvirtis = improved cylinder, pusė = modified, trys ketvirčiai = improved modified, pilnas = full.","checklist":false},{"k":"chokes-names-and-marks-kp4","html":"Žvaigždutės: kuo daugiau žvaigždučių, tuo atviresnis čokas.","checklist":false},{"k":"chokes-names-and-marks-kp5","html":"Reikšmės apytikslės ir skiriasi tarp gamintojų.","checklist":false}],"did_you_know":{"k":"chokes-names-and-marks-dyk","html":"Šiuolaikiniai varžybiniai vamzdžiai dažnai turi truputį platesnį kanalą (overbore) – platesnį už standartą tam kalibrui. Todėl tas pats čokas su tuo pačiu pavadinimu skirtinguose šautuvuose gali duoti truputį skirtingą susiaurinimą: svarbu skirtumas tarp kanalo ir čoko."},"quiz":[{"k":"chokes-names-and-marks-q1","q":"Koks apytikslis susiaurinimas modified (1/2) čoko 12 kalibrui?","options":[{"k":"a","text":"0 mm"},{"k":"b","text":"Apie 0,25 mm"},{"k":"c","text":"Apie 0,5 mm"},{"k":"d","text":"Apie 1 mm"}],"correct":"c","explain":"Modified yra apie 0,5 mm, arba apie 20 thou."},{"k":"chokes-names-and-marks-q2","q":"Ką reiškia čokas su keturiomis žvaigždutėmis ant Beretta šautuvo?","options":[{"k":"a","text":"Full"},{"k":"b","text":"Improved cylinder (1/4)"},{"k":"c","text":"Modified (1/2)"},{"k":"d","text":"Improved modified (3/4)"}],"correct":"b","explain":"Žvaigždučių sistemoje kuo daugiau žvaigždučių, tuo atviresnis čokas: keturios žvaigždutės – improved cylinder."},{"k":"chokes-names-and-marks-q4","q":"Kurį čoką Europoje vadina „pusčokas“?","options":[{"k":"a","text":"Modified (pusčokas)"},{"k":"b","text":"Improved cylinder (ketvirtinis čokas)"},{"k":"c","text":"Full (pilnas čokas)"},{"k":"d","text":"Cylinder (cilindras)"}],"correct":"a","explain":"„Pusė“ (1/2) – tai modified; „ketvirtis“ – improved cylinder, „trys ketvirčiai“ – improved modified."}],"terms":[{"id":"choke","en":"Choke","local":"čokas","label":"Choke (čokas)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/choke/"},{"id":"constriction","en":"Constriction","local":"susiaurinimas","label":"Constriction (susiaurinimas)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/constriction/"},{"id":"cylinder","en":"Cylinder","local":"cilindras","label":"Cylinder (cilindras)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/cylinder/"},{"id":"improved-cylinder","en":"Improved cylinder","local":"ketvirtinis čokas","label":"Improved cylinder (ketvirtinis čokas)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/improved-cylinder/"},{"id":"light-modified","en":"Light modified","local":"lengvas modifikuotas čokas","label":"Light modified (lengvas modifikuotas čokas)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/light-modified/"},{"id":"modified","en":"Modified","local":"pusčokas","label":"Modified (pusčokas)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/modified/"},{"id":"improved-modified","en":"Improved modified","local":"trys ketvirčiai","label":"Improved modified (trys ketvirčiai)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/improved-modified/"},{"id":"full-choke","en":"Full choke","local":"pilnas čokas","label":"Full choke (pilnas čokas)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/full-choke/"},{"id":"star-marks","en":"Star marks","local":"žvaigždučių žymėjimas","label":"Star marks (žvaigždučių žymėjimas)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/star-marks/"},{"id":"gunsmith","en":"Gunsmith","local":"ginklininkas","label":"Gunsmith (ginklininkas)","url":"https://juliabezdolna.github.io/clayaway/lt/glossary/gunsmith/"}],"rule_refs":[],"sources":[{"title":"Briley — Understanding chokes: 12-gauge constriction chart (inches)","url":"https://www.briley.com/c-456-understanding-chokes.aspx","fitasc":false},{"title":"Beretta — choke tube identification: stars, notches and codes","url":"https://estore.beretta.com/en-gb/utility/choke-tubes-identification","fitasc":false}],"evidence":[],"more_in_en":0}
